{"type":"text","timestamp":1794320608916,"sessionID":"ses_e3a3844d8ffehoyD00R8Nc4Z4v","part":{"id":"prt_1c5d7ae860011oMBS1ykyFI4HQ","messageID":"msg_1c5d78c02001DAE3tE9sZJP1Ce","sessionID":"ses_e3a3844d8ffehoyD00R8Nc4Z4v","type":"text","text":"That failure is a wrong expectation in my test — spec says open todos without due date order by *newest first*, so \"No due date\" (newer) must precede \"Minimal\". The API output is correct. Fixing the test:","time":{"start":1794320608902,"end":1794320608913}}}
